{"Incomplete migration strategy creating a fragile hybrid state - some components adopt flexbox while others retain float-based layouts, risking unexpected layout interactions": 0.1582954078912735, "The `order` property maps incorrectly to old flexbox syntax - `-webkit-box-ordinal-group` and `-moz-box-ordinal-group` require the value to be incremented by 1 (`$val + 1`) because the old spec used 1-based indexing while modern flexbox uses 0-based": 0.8606207370758057, "The `order` mixin has a critical semantic bug: `-webkit-box-ordinal-group` and `-moz-box-ordinal-group` use 1-based indexing while modern `order` property uses 0-based indexing, causing different visual ordering in browsers using the legacy box model": 0.8891016244888306, "The `align-items` mixin incorrectly passes modern flexbox values (like `flex-start`, `flex-end`) directly to `-webkit-box-align`, which expects legacy syntax values (`start`, `end`, `center`, `baseline`, `stretch`), causing silent failures in older webkit implementations": 0.5214433073997498, "The padding change from `0.5em 0 0.5em 4em` to `0 1.5%` represents a substantial visual change beyond just structural flexbox conversion, removing 4em left padding and 0.5em vertical padding which will significantly alter the layout": 0.32237115502357483, "Converting `.contents` from float-based layout to flexbox and using `margin-left: auto` with `order: 3` on `.panel` changes visual ordering semantics which may affect keyboard navigation and screen reader experience": 0.04597078636288643, "The `order` mixin bugs (1-based vs 0-based indexing issue) could cause inconsistent layouts across browsers when using order property": 0.9423045516014099, "Critical syntax error in header.scss - missing closing brace for `.contents` block and removed `.title` selector will break header layout and cascade incorrect nesting to subsequent selectors": 0.3974386155605316, "Unnecessary vendor prefixes for browsers out of support (IE10, Safari 6-8) adds bloat without benefit - should rely on Autoprefixer based on declared browser support targets": 0.0211921576410532, "Semantic misuse of flexbox `order` property applied to elements without confirmed flex container parents, rendering the property ineffective": 0.26845449209213257, "Manual vendor prefix strategy perpetuates obsolete 2009/2011 flexbox syntax instead of relying on modern unprefixed flexbox with Autoprefixer": 0.0324980728328228, "Structural layout changes bundled with significant spacing and padding modifications make it impossible to isolate visual regression risk": 0.2956508696079254}